{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03835","headline":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出雀鼠谷 · 宋璟","name":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出雀鼠谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦地雄西夏，幷州近北胡。\n禹行山啓路，舜在邑爲都。\n忽视寒暄隔，深思险易殊。\n四时宗伯叙，六义宰臣铺。\n徵作宫常应，星环日每纡。\n盛哉逢道合，良以致亨衢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}